  "title": "Unified Title",
  "summary": "Plan-and-Patch and PearlVLA are two frameworks for improving long-horizon planning in AI systems, with Plan-and-Patch focusing on plan repair using diffusion language models, and PearlVLA refining latent plans through feedback and a frozen latent world model.",
